    "caveats": [
      "Observed reply timestamps precede decoding and validation; host_excess includes required checks, audit copying, receive handling and scheduling. It is not a guaranteed removable cost.",
      "Reply tail is host-observed and cannot distinguish adapter, CAN, motor, USB or host scheduling delays.",
      "Per-bus costs overlap; never sum front and rear to predict whole-pipeline gains."
    ],
    "script_sha256": "04d20325a884713c63ed660cff1883eed4a65420cd8d637b896cc72fb524b220",
    "formula": "For write i>0: paced=previous write finish+0.6ms; slot=sorted prior receive times[i-3] when i>=3; legal=max(paced,slot). Window wait=legal-paced; host excess=actual write start-legal. Sum all write durations+5 gaps+window waits+host excess equals per-bus write span."
  }
